<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 549 0 R
/E (The system analyzes historical customer-product interactions, including product views, add-to-cart actions, and completed transactions. The raw interaction data is explored and transformed into meaningful behavioral features such as interaction frequency, product engagement, cart additions, and purchase activity.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
190 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 550 0 R
/E (For purchase prediction, Logistic Regression and HistGradientBoosting are used and compared to identify the better-performing model. The selected model predicts the probability that a customer will purchase a product within 7 days based on their previous behavior. These purchase probabilities are then used to rank products and generate personalized recommendations.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
